        "block_1_RdQNyK": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Recycling Instructions",
            "content": "",
            "html": "<script src=\"https://app.bluebirdclimate.com/embed/summer-fridays?id=A52_QqNR_2XtT3UmAIAh-8hexVE14TIrNl_brRsznQuH9SsggioHSGWtVZ9zSRPFyoFyWZUbeoq2VqHEOR_u1kY72mdyy5zH9hEW7hKfyMy0pr0XRML8hQ\" async=\"\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>"
          }
        },
        "block_1_8MEpJY": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SUSTAINABILITY",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_GJErhL": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Dream Lip Oil vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_EPAw3e": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Dream Lip Oil gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Dream Lip Oil is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products.</p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.<br/></p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_bD9rgM": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Dream Lip Oil suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Dream Lip Oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_AkcyGE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the undertones of Dream Lip Oil shades?",
            "content": "<p>Pink Cloud – Neutral<br/>Blush Dreams – Warm neutral<br/>Soft Mauve – Cool<br/>Rosewood Nights – Warm</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_LVhXpE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is Dream Lip Oil different from Lip Butter Balm?",
            "content": "<p>Dream Lip Oil is a silky-smooth lip oil infused with skincare benefits that hydrate, nourish and enhance moisture. It’s perfect to layer with lipstick for added hydration and color dimension, but can also be worn on its own.<br/><br/>Lip Butter Balm comes in seven different shades and flavors and has a thick buttery texture. It’s perfect for on-the-go instant hydration, shine, and a flush of color -- it can also be worn as an overnight lip mask. </p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_yYdqK4": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the finish?",
            "content": "<p>Dream Lip Oil infuses moisture into the lips, leaving a high-shine, milky, non-sticky finish.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
